# Values that must not fill the {name} recording title.
# The connector templates ("as {name}", "called {name}") are greedy over
# free-form text, so everyday phrasings like "start recording as usual" or
# "call it that" would otherwise bind a pronoun or adverb as the title.
# Excluding these keeps such utterances as an unnamed recording.
it
that
this
one
usual
normal
